For the past two weeks, I have felt anxious before work and have slept only five hours most nights. I have not had thoughts of harming myself, and I plan to speak with my counselor on Friday.
My panic attacks returned this month after a quiet year. During an attack my heart races and I feel dizzy, but the symptoms usually ease after ten minutes.
I stopped taking my medication three days ago because it made me nauseated. I feel worse today and intend to call my prescribing clinician.
